packetfin: "bogus" is not a valid field output option=value pair.
Packetfin: The available options for field output "E" are:
bom=y|n    Prepend output with the UTF-8 BOM (def: N: no)
header=y|n    Print field abbreviations as first line of output (def: N: no)
separator=/t|/s|<character>   Set the separator to use;
     "/t" = tab, "/s" = space (def: /t: tab)
occurrence=f|l|a  Select the occurrence of a field to use;
     "f" = first, "l" = last, "a" = all (def: a: all)
aggregator=,|/s|<character>   Set the aggregator to use;
     "," = comma, "/s" = space (def: ,: comma)
quote=d|s|n   Print either d: double-quotes, s: single quotes or 
     n: no quotes around field values (def: n: none)
